;; Session fixture (docs/incremental.md B4/B5): a two-stratum monotone
;; cone -- endpoint reads path reads edge.  A batch into edge must route
;; through replay-entry (multi-stratum cones stay off delta-entry until
;; boundary-delta capture, M0), re-firing both strata.

table (edge int int)
table (path int int)
table (endpoint int)

rule (edge 1 2) (edge 2 3)

rule (edge X Y) --> (path X Y)
rule (path X Y) (edge Y Z) --> (path X Z)

rule (path X Y) --> (endpoint Y)
